H(\boldsymbol{x},{\boldsymbol y})\hspace{-0.65em}&=\hspace{-0.65em}&\Phi({\boldsymbol y}-\boldsymbol{x})&\text{if}&{\boldsymbol y}\in\partial\Omega.
\end{array}\right.
\end{align*}
