where ${\mathbb B}=\left\{0,\cdots,r\right\}^d\setminus\left\{\0\right\}$ is the framelet band.

Then the frame coefficients $W_{l,\boldsymbol{\alpha}}u\in{\mathcal I}_d$ of $u\in{\mathcal I}_d$ at level $l$ and band $\boldsymbol{\alpha}$ are defined as
